From 1747b5fe8304723359a2295e8509042c1d20115d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:21:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(cli): the usage hook, the local database and arp status
 (v0, week 1)

A Claude Code hook records every MCP tool call on the machine: tool,
function, outcome category, status code, duration. Never an argument, a
response or an error message. arp status reads it back per tool, most
urgent first, with the network column present but not yet read.

Hooks run async and exit 0 on any failure, so the agent's call is never
affected (ADR 0045). Nothing leaves the machine in this version.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LbBB4eJoCL2vCKjJ4BjBLY
